    "message": "Check queues longer than their room on the shared generated Scenario\n\nThe tests built their own Scenario with InitialScenarioBuilder (seed 7)\nwith entered stock for 40, 10 or 30 evacuees. They now pass the same\nevacuee count and stock to the shared generated_scenario_with fixture\n(#88), and the day-long run also passes duration_days=1.\n\nThe two queue-progress tests move to tests/unit/domain/test_movement.py;\nthe day-long, long_simulation run stays here as the integration test.\nAll three still hold with the shared seed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
